# literal_translation = And even as hounds and lusty youths press upon a boar on this side and on that, and he comes forth from the deep thicket, whetting his white tusks in his curving jaws, and they charge upon him on either side, and thereat arises the sound of the gnashing of tusks; but immediately they remain his onset, how dread soever he be; even so then around Odysseus, dear to Zeus, did the Trojans press.
